# ---- Stray generated output ----
# If a script is run from a non-root working directory it may create a nested
# results/ or fig/ folder next to itself. Those are ignored; the committed
# deliverables live in the root-level results/ and fig/ folders (kept tracked).
**/results/
**/fig/
!/results/
!/fig/
